 S ^VCOMP=000000+0000,^VCORR=0 D ^VEXAMINE
223 S ^ABSN="10436",^ITEM="I-22.3  100+0",^NEXT="224^V1BOA1,V1BOA2^V1BOA,V1BOR^VV1" D ^V1PRESET
 S ^VCOMP=100+0,^VCORR=100 D ^VEXAMINE
