231 S ^ABSN="10440",^ITEM="I-23.1  2+3",^NEXT="232^V1BOA1,V1BOA2^V1BOA,V1BOR^VV1" D ^V1PRESET
 S ^VCOMP=2+3,^VCORR=5 D ^VEXAMINE
