 S ^VCORR="11 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 a3a(3)#11 1 11 1 1 0 1 0 a3a(3)b3b(3)c3d3#11 1 1 0 10 1 0 0 a3a(3)b3c(3)#11 1 1 0 10 1 0 0 a2a(2)b2c(2)#11 1 1 0 1 0 1 0 a2a(2)BCD#"
 D ^VEXAMINE
